  "translate_en|mods/smallanimalbox/42.21/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Tooltip.json|Tooltip_SAB_AnimalCarrier": "A large moulded plastic animal carrier with a hinged wire door. Empty encumbrance: 1.5. Holds four supported adults OR ten babies; mixed contents share capacity. Right-click an animal and choose Store. On the ground, open the door to let its occupants leave. Animals still need food and water.",
  "translate_en|mods/smallanimalbox/42.21/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Tooltip.json|Tooltip_SAB_Box": "Animal-only carrier. Stored animals use body weight; adult chickens add at most 4 each. Empty encumbrance: 3. Capacity depends on animal size. Right-click to store a held animal or take a named occupant. On the ground, open the door to let animals leave after individual random delays of 1–5 seconds. Storing an animal, picking up or raising the box closes it. Animals still need care.",
  "translate_en|mods/smallanimalbox/42.21/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Tooltip.json|Tooltip_SAB_CompactAnimalCarrier": "A small moulded plastic animal carrier with a hinged wire door. Empty encumbrance: 0.5. Holds one supported adult OR four babies; mixed contents share capacity. Right-click an animal and choose Store. On the ground, open the door to let its occupants leave. Animals still need food and water.",
  "translate_en|mods/smallanimalbox/42.21/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Tooltip.json|Tooltip_SAB_CompactBox": "Animal-only carrier. Stored animals use body weight; adult chickens add at most 4 each. Empty encumbrance: 1. Holds one supported adult OR up to four babies; mixed contents share capacity. Right-click to store a held animal or take a named occupant. On the ground, open the door to let animals leave after individual random delays of 1–5 seconds. Storing an animal, picking up or raising the box closes it. Animals still need care.",
  "translate_en|mods/smallanimalbox/42.21/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Tooltip.json|Tooltip_SAB_CompactWireCarrier": "A small welded-wire animal cage with a hinged door and wire floor. No solid base or tray. Empty encumbrance: 0.85. Holds one supported adult OR four babies; mixed contents share capacity. Right-click an animal and choose Store. On the ground, open the door to let its occupants leave. Animals still need food and water.",
  "translate_en|mods/smallanimalbox/42.21/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Tooltip.json|Tooltip_SAB_LoadInstructions": "Right-click an animal and choose Store, then select an animal crate in your inventory or on nearby ground. Full boxes show Not enough space.",
  "translate_en|mods/smallanimalbox/42.21/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Tooltip.json|Tooltip_SAB_WireCarrier": "A large welded-wire animal cage with a hinged door and wire floor. No solid base or tray. Empty encumbrance: 2.5. Holds four supported adults OR ten babies; mixed contents share capacity. Right-click an animal and choose Store. On the ground, open the door to let its occupants leave. Animals still need food and water."
